{"lesson_uid":"L0044","_provenance":{"generator":"backend/scripts/generate_lesson_zhuyin.py","reading_authority":"frontend/src/components/zhuyin/polyphonicProcessor.ts（跑，非移植）","source_font":"frontend/public/fonts/BpmfZihiSerif-Regular.ttf","font_sha256_16":"fc25a90d27699ec4","poyin_db_sha256_16":"2d4d4c9f1d0ec1a6","notation":"pypinyin BopomofoConverter（與 font_readings.json 同一個轉換器）","stats":{"texts":217,"chars":6979,"poly_positions":2006,"he_adjudicated":0,"xiang_adjudicated":0,"manual_corrections":0}},"texts":[{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"yqxqv","idx":1,"text":"每天上學或放學走路過馬路時，要看小綠人和小紅人；公車或汽車行經路口時，也得留意紅綠燈。這些沉默的號誌，用明亮的顏色提醒大家：什麼時候可以走，什麼時候要停，什麼時候要慢下來注意。如果過馬路時完全不看號誌，也許只想快速通過，或是眼裡只有在馬路對面等待的朋友，就很容易發生意外。所以，在過馬路時，我們不只要看前方，也要留意路口出現的號誌提醒。","n":168,"ssz":"...................1................1...........................................................1......................................................................."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"yqxqv","idx":2,"text":"而讀文章時，也是一樣的。文章就像一條文字道路，我們的眼睛一路往前走。可是，如果只顧著一直讀、一直讀，卻不注意標點符號，就像在路上不看號誌，很容易錯過作者留下的重要提醒。","n":84,"ssz":"........1...................1.............2...2....1............1..................."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"yqxqv","idx":3,"text":"有些標點符號，是我們很熟悉的閱讀號誌。句號像紅燈，提醒我們：「這句話說完了，可以停一下，整理一下目前讀到的訊息。」逗號像黃燈，提醒我們：「先減速慢一點，這句話還沒結束。」標點符號不只幫助我們調整閱讀的速度，也能提示句子之間的關係，讓意思不會全部擠在一起。","n":127,"ssz":".........................................1....1..........................2..................................1........21.....2.."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"yqxqv","idx":4,"text":"不過，有些標點符號的任務比較特別。像是冒號、分號、破折號，它們是文字路上的特殊號誌，除了提醒我們停頓，也提醒我們要留意關鍵訊息。","n":64,"ssz":"1..............................................................."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"yqxqv","idx":5,"text":"看到冒號，可以先往後看。冒號常常像「接著說明」的號誌，提醒我們：冒號後接著要進一步交代的內容，可能是說明或舉例。例如：「我帶了三樣東西：水壺、外套、鉛筆盒。」冒號後面列出的，就是「三樣東西」的舉例。","n":99,"ssz":".......................................1..........................................................."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"yqxqv","idx":6,"text":"看到分號，可以先觀察總共分成幾組，再找出各組相同或不同的地方。例如：「熱鬧的下課時間，有人喜歡找同學聊天，有人則安靜的看書；有人跑去福利社，有人則到操場打球。」分號前後分成兩組，前一組說明下課時間學生在教室內的活動，後一組則呈現教室外的活動。分號就像「文字分流」的號誌，提醒我們先把文句分組，再歸納各組的主題或特色。","n":158,"ssz":"......................1...................................................................2..................2................................................"},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"yqxqv","idx":7,"text":"看到破折號，可以先停一下，判斷它是在補充說明，還是讓語意出現轉折。有時候，破折號是在補充說明，例如：「我最擔心的事，真的發生了——我被大家誤會了。」破折號後面說明了「我最擔心的事」是什麼。有時，破折號也會讓意思突然轉向，例如：「我以為他會拒絕我——他竟然答應了。」這時候，破折號後面的內容，讓事情和前面想的不一樣。","n":157,"ssz":"..........1.............................................................................................2......................11...................1.....1.."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"yqxqv","idx":8,"text":"所以，標點符號不是文章裡可有可無的小記號。它們像文字路上的閱讀號誌，幫我們看清楚作者安排的路線。","n":48,"ssz":".......1........................................"},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"yqxqv","idx":9,"text":"下次讀文章時，如果遇到冒號、分號、破折號，可以先停一下，想一想：這個號誌正在提醒我什麼？看懂這些小提醒，就比較不會遺漏重點，也能幫助我們找到解題所需的線索。","n":78,"ssz":".........................1.......1.....................1......................"},{"section":"served:series","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一般","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:title","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"文字路上的閱讀號誌","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:genre","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"說明文","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:reading_strategy","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"解題策略──看特殊標點找線索","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:reading_strategy_explained","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這一課我們要練習的是，像偵探一樣，仔細觀察文章裡那些「特別的符號」們，從它們那裡挖出作者藏起來的線索\n為什麼要練這個呢\n因為這篇介紹的文章，就是用很多像冒號、分號、破折號這些「閱讀號誌」，來告訴我們該怎麼閱讀、怎麼去理解作者的意思，就像紅綠燈告訴我們什麼時候該停、什麼時候該走一樣\n讀的時候\n你可以試著停下來，看看這些符號出現在哪裡，它們後面跟著什麼內容，猜猜看它們想讓你知道什麼，這樣就能幫助你更輕鬆地讀懂喔","n":205,"ssz":".1............1....................................1.....1...1....................................................2.......................1..............................................................1..1"},{"section":"served:reading_strategy_explained#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這一課我們要練習的是，像偵探一樣，仔細觀察文章裡那些「特別的符號」們，從它們那裡挖出作者藏起來的線索","n":50,"ssz":".1............1..................................."},{"section":"served:reading_strategy_explained#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"為什麼要練這個呢","n":8,"ssz":"1.....1."},{"section":"served:reading_strategy_explained#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"因為這篇介紹的文章，就是用很多像冒號、分號、破折號這些「閱讀號誌」，來告訴我們該怎麼閱讀、怎麼去理解作者的意思，就像紅綠燈告訴我們什麼時候該停、什麼時候該走一樣","n":80,"ssz":".1....................................................2.......................1."},{"section":"served:reading_strategy_explained#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"讀的時候","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:reading_strategy_explained#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"你可以試著停下來，看看這些符號出現在哪裡，它們後面跟著什麼內容，猜猜看它們想讓你知道什麼，這樣就能幫助你更輕鬆地讀懂喔","n":59,"ssz":".......................................................1..1"},{"section":"served:intro.background","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這篇文章將帶領我們認識文章中的「閱讀號誌」——標點符號。就像過馬路時需要看紅綠燈一樣，閱讀時也需要留意標點符號，它們能幫助我們調整閱讀速度，理解作者想傳達的意思。文章會介紹句號和逗號這兩個熟悉的號誌，以及冒號、分號、破折號這些比較特別的號誌。透過認識它們各自的功能，例如冒號用來引導說明或舉例，分號用來區分並列的內容，破折號用來補充說明或表示語意轉折，我們就能更清楚地掌握文章的重點和作者的思路，讓閱讀更加順暢。","n":206,"ssz":"........................................1......................................2........1....1.........................................................................................1.......1.............."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[0].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[0].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"閱讀聚光燈","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:text_type","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"單","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一、特殊標點──分號","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"分號．標點介紹","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.標點介紹：","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].columns[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"名稱","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].columns[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"符號","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].columns[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"出現時機","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].columns[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"閱讀時怎麼做","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].rows[0][0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"分號","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].rows[0][2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"分號把內容分成幾組，各組之間在意思或句型上有關聯","n":24,"ssz":"................2......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].rows[0][3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"看到分號，先分組，再看各組哪裡相同、哪裡不同","n":22,"ssz":"...............1......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].example","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"例子：夏天的山林，綠意盎然；冬天的山林，白雪茫茫。","n":25,"ssz":".1......................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"分號．策略說明","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.策略說明：\n❶圈標點：圈出分號，把文句分組。\n❷讀文意：讀出每一組的主要意思。\n❸看關係：比較各組間的關係，是強調相同的重點，還是呈現不同的狀況。\n❹順文意：如果還有其他前後文，就需要統整全文來看。","n":101,"ssz":".................................2.....2..................11........................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.策略說明：","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❶圈標點：圈出分號，把文句分組。","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❷讀文意：讀出每一組的主要意思。","n":16,"ssz":"........2.....2."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❸看關係：比較各組間的關係，是強調相同的重點，還是呈現不同的狀況。","n":33,"ssz":"................11..............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❹順文意：如果還有其他前後文，就需要統整全文來看。","n":25,"ssz":"........................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"分號．小試身手","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"3.小試身手：","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"紅色 ☑、紅色手寫字與紅框圈標點（皆為圖形），文字流無此資訊","n":30,"ssz":".............................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[0].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(1) 鯨魚與蝙蝠","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[0].quote","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(1)「鯨魚是哺乳類，不是魚類；蝙蝠是哺乳類，不是鳥類。」","n":29,"ssz":"...........1...........1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[0].items[0].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❶圈標點：圈出分號，把文句分組，確認分組，共【　】組","n":26,"ssz":".........................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[0].items[1].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"→第一組強調鯨魚是","n":9,"ssz":".....1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[0].items[2].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"→第二組強調蝙蝠是","n":9,"ssz":".....1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[0].items[3].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❸看關係：→兩組有共同點，都在釐清動物的分類，鯨魚和蝙蝠都是【　】","n":33,"ssz":".........................1......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[1].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(2) 勤勞","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[1].quote","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(2)「勤勞能幫助農人，使他收穫豐富；幫助工人，使他產品精美；幫助商人，使他貨物暢銷；幫助學生，使他成績優良。」","n":56,"ssz":"........................................................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[1].items[0].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❶圈標點：圈出分號，把文句分組，確認分組，共【　】組。","n":27,"ssz":"..........................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[1].items[1].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"→第一組的人物是【　】，勤勞帶給他","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[1].items[2].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"→第二組的人物是【　】，勤勞帶給他","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[1].items[3].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"→第三組的人物是【　】，勤勞帶給他","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[1].items[4].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"→第四組的人物是【　】，勤勞帶給他","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].items[1].items[5].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"→四組有共同點，都在強調【　】能帶來好處。","n":21,"ssz":"...........1.......1."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"分號．實戰演練","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"4.實戰演練：","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[0].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(1) 112年會考「彎曲的生命旅路」","n":19,"ssz":"............1......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[0].quote","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(1)「彎曲的生命旅路，常常會被安排與許多人與事錯身而過，有些注定是淡漠的，並淪為遺忘；有些則產生強烈衝擊，終至刻骨銘心。」","n":62,"ssz":".....1........................................................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[0].source_label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"（文句引自112年會考國文科）","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[0].stem","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"依據這段文字，下列何者最符合文意？","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[0].options.A","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"人生會遇見許多人事，有些淡去，有些留下深刻影響","n":23,"ssz":"......................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[0].options.B","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"人生中越是短暫的相遇，越容易形成深刻而長久的記憶","n":24,"ssz":"........1..............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[0].options.C","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"人生經歷是否被記住，主要取決於相遇時間的長短","n":22,"ssz":"...............1......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[0].options.D","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"人生旅途難免錯過，重要的是努力保留每一段回憶","n":22,"ssz":"..................1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[0].items[1].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"→第一組寫有些事情的印象是【　】的，最後會","n":21,"ssz":"....................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[0].items[2].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"→第二組寫有些事情帶來強烈【　】，最後會","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[0].items[3].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❸看關係：→兩組呈現","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[0].items[4].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"強調不同事情會留下","n":9,"ssz":".1......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[0].items[4].tail","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"印象。","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[0].items[5].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"→根據上述的整理和理解，只有【  A  】選項強調事情帶來的不同影響，因此答案選【  A  】。","n":48,"ssz":"........1...............1......................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[1].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(2) 104年會考「每個人都是特別的」","n":20,"ssz":"............1......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[1].instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(2) 這一題換你試試看：","n":13,"ssz":".....2......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[1].quote","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「如果每個人都是特別的，那就沒有一個特別；如果每個人都得到一個獎杯，獎杯就變得毫無意義。生活最甜美的樂趣，在於承認自己並不特別。」 這段文字的涵義，與下列何者最接近？","n":83,"ssz":"....1............1......1.....1.......1.....................1......................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[1].source_label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"（104會考國文科第21題）","n":14,"ssz":".....